OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of Red Bull cans stolen
OL,4,Ain overnight raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have stolen thousands of cans
OL,7,Fof Red Bull in an overnight raid at an
OL,8,Findustrial estate.
OL,10,FIt happened on Thursday at a logistics
OL,11,Fcompany on Capitol Trading Estate in
OL,12,FKnowsley Industrial Park, Knowsley,
OL,13,FMerseyside.
OL,15,FTwenty-six pallets of the energy drink
OL,16,Fand "a quantity" of Wrigley's chewing
OL,17,Fgum were taken, Merseyside Police said.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
