OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of Red Bull cans stolen
OL,4,Ain overnight raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the stolen stock was
OL,7,Fworth "tens of thousands" and that it
OL,8,Fwas carrying out a forensic examination
OL,9,Fand gathering CCTV footage to track
OL,10,Fdown those responsible.
